        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1703">

                <pb facs="1387" n="1271" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg1271"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 834.00/118.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Montevideo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1911-12-12">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 12, 1911</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>At the request of the Diplomatic Corps, the Argentine and Brazilian naval
                    commanders at Asuncion have forbidden revolutionist war vessels to shell the
                    city and unfortified places. Brazil will send more war vessels.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Grevstad.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
